  "type": "MULTIPLE_CHOICE",
  "data": {
    "body": "Infrared spectroscopy can be used to study carbon-carbon and carbon-oxygen bonding. If $v$ is the symbol for the frequency of a stretching vibration, which of the following pairs of statements is correct?\n",
    "solution": [
      2
    ],
    "answerChoices": [
      {
        "id": "9c6d4dd7-7684-4d8f-b8b8-919981b03882",
        "index": 0,
        "body": "$\\quad v(\\mathrm{C} \\equiv \\mathrm{C})<v(\\mathrm{C}=\\mathrm{C})<v(\\mathrm{C}-\\mathrm{C}) \\quad$ and $\\quad v\\mathrm{(C=O)}<v\\mathrm{~(C-O)}$",
        "questionId": "909c2c05-582a-411b-b397-ffe4110008ed",
        "stats": {
          "count": 627
        },
        "resources": []
      },
      {
        "id": "9229db97-e3f4-4138-9f7b-f676835d8b20",
        "index": 1,
        "body": "$v(\\mathrm{C}-\\mathrm{C}) \\approx v(\\mathrm{C}-\\mathrm{O})\\quad $and $\\quad v(\\mathrm{C}=\\mathrm{C}) \\approx v(\\mathrm{C}=\\mathrm{O})$",
        "questionId": "909c2c05-582a-411b-b397-ffe4110008ed",
        "stats": {
          "count": 105
        },
        "resources": []
      },
      {
        "id": "3fc7ebf0-b34e-4a4c-834f-b3911f3f92de",
        "index": 2,
